      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [
        "attack"
      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The blood-awakened tree's last action was a successful root Strike against a target currently taking persistent bleed damage.</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The tree drives its roots into the target's open wounds and drinks their blood. The roots Strike deals piercing damage with an additional 2d6 piercing, and the tree recovers hit points equal to half the additional damage dealt.</p>",
